.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_port_delete" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_port_delete" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_port_delete \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported Port - Delete
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_port_delete
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_port_delete_data *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "data" 12
Delete data buffer, see \fIstruct nvme_exported_port_delete_data\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported Port
command with SEL value NVME_MANAGE_EXPORT_PORT_SEL_DELETE.
